<table cellpadding=1 cellspacing=2 bordercolor=#000099 bgcolor=#dcdcff border=2 width=80%>
<tr><td bgcolor=#000099><font color=#ffaaaa><b>■[1753] soulfireクエスト</b>
<div align=right><a href="bbs.cgi?action=resview&resno=1753">
<img src="icondata/res.gif" border=0></a></div></td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor=#000000>&nbsp;&nbsp;summon 
</td></tr><tr><td align=right><table border=0 cellpadding=1 cellspacing=1 width=95%><tr><td align=center>
<img src="icondata/blank.gif" width=32 height=32 border=0>
</td><td width=90%><font color=#000000>Groflah Steadirtを二回目に合うため夜にEastFreeportのSeafarerに行って見ましだが<br>いなくてGroflah Steadirtを始めて見たところでいつ動くのかずっと待ってたんですが<br>夜になっても動かないんですね。なぜでしょうか。。<br><br>BRICKS　OF　IRON　OREを売っていた西FPのオガはそれを売ってないのはなぜでしょうか？．．<br><br>EastFreeportのSeafarerに行く前にあるCARTOGRAPER　PIRIからもらうクエストは<br>余り調べられないがどうやってしますか？<br><br>ALTUNICJATINにメモを伝えるのどこでいますか。。教えてくたさいませんか</font><div align=right><small>
<br><font color=#990000> </font>
<br><font color=#000099> 5/25(Tue) 09:20</font><font color=#000000>
 &nbsp;&nbsp;[<a href="bbs.cgi?action=edit&lno=1753&rno=0"><font color=#000099>編集</font></a>]
[<a href="bbs.cgi?action=delete&lno=1753&rno=0
"><font color=#000099>削除</font></a>]</font></small>
</div></td></tr></table>
<div align=right><table border=0 width=90%><tr><td colspan=2 bgcolor=#660033>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Fujico<small> <font color=#ffaaaa>(Lv: 15 山の民
 <font color=#ff8800>Life: 1804</font> <font color=#9999ff>Mana: 2812</font>)</font>&nbsp;[<a href="http://www.nona.dti.ne.jp/~saylath/eq/" target=_blank>URL</a>]
</td></tr><tr><td align=center><img src="icondata/rogue.gif" border=0>
</td><td width=90%><font color=#000000>昼間にD-ELF女が立っている所に現れるそうです。<br>しかし、ランダムSpawnらしいです。<br>2日待っても出なかった人もいるそうです。<br>とにかく待つしかないようです。<br></font>
<div align=right><small>
<br><font color=#990000>△Life 46pt 獲得! △Mana 7pt 獲得!</font>
<br><font color=#000099> 5/25(Tue) 12:40</font><font color=#000000><small>
 &nbsp;&nbsp;[<a href="bbs.cgi?action=edit&lno=1753&rno=1"><font color=#000099>編集</font></a>]
[<a href="bbs.cgi?action=delete&lno=1753&rno=1
"><font color=#000099>削除</font></a>]</font></small>
</small></div></td></tr></table>
</td></tr></table>
<br><br>
<table cellpadding=1 cellspacing=2 bordercolor=#000099 bgcolor=#dcdcff border=2 width=80%>
<tr><td bgcolor=#000099><font color=#ffaaaa><b>■[1752] What is yer think?</b>
<div align=right><a href="bbs.cgi?action=resview&resno=1752">
<img src="icondata/res.gif" border=0></a></div></td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor=#000000>&nbsp;&nbsp;Lusny 
</td></tr><tr><td align=right><table border=0 cellpadding=1 cellspacing=1 width=95%><tr><td align=center>
<img src="icondata/rogue.gif" border=0>
</td><td width=90%><font color=#000000>Actually, AB members poping not enough for raids. <br>I know this reason is every members has RL work and RL problem.. <br>so cant make everyday pop.. <br>So, I offer 'How about make raid day and time?' and pick day, time after reset raid day and time. <br>I think it is better than nothing to do now. <br>I told this to Futur, Yuta, Koyuki, and Aasadal officers asking this to members. <br>Think about our raids.. We was very close to EP... <br>We have enough power and tactics to enter the EP. <br>only problem is just few members poping, so cant do more raids now.. <br>We was just do Seru and BoT Tower in 2 weeks. <br>just problem was 'NOT' enough members for raid.<br>Please post yer think. <br>If u can easy pop Tues day 8pm.. then post 'Tues day, 8pm' and yer think. <br><br>EX) Lusny's best raid day and time is SAT, MON and 8pm after....and good raid day is.. <br>Tues, Friday, Monday.. and 9pm after..then post.. <br><br>Best : Mon, Saturday 8pm(KST) <br>Good : Mon, Tues, Friday 9pm(KST) <br></font><div align=right><small>
